+/* ---- Live tabs (prototype) ----
+   The shell (the window's page) shows a tab as a frame holding that tab's own page, below
+   its top bar; its own module sections and project bar never show. A tab's page (embed)
+   shows its project bar and module, without the header (the logo and the tabs) or the
+   footer. A tab not on show is a frame not displayed. */
+html.live-shell #projectBar { display: none !important; }
